h-Hans\">哥哥给了我一个可爱的娃娃。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">乾かす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわかす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">烘干；晾干；使干燥</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"89850\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>皿<rp>(</rp><rt>さら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>洗<rp>(</rp><rt>あら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い、それから<ruby>乾<rp>(</rp><rt>かわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她洗了盘子,然后干了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">乾く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">干；变干；干燥</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212788\">そのぬれたシャツはすぐに<ruby>乾<rp>(</rp><rt>かわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くだろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这件干燥的衬衫很快就会干燥。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">渇く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">口渴；感到口渴；渴望；渴求</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"2310151\">お<ruby>腹<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>空<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いたし、のども<ruby>渇<rp>(</rp><rt>かわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我饿了,他们都渴了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">交わす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">交换（信息、问候、争论等）；相交；交叉；交织；互相…；彼此…</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166653\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはあいさつを<ruby>交<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わし<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们互相问好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">為替</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわせ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">汇票；汇款单；外汇；汇兑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76748\">この<ruby>為替<rp>(</rp><rt>かわせ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るのに<ruby>銀行<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>手数料<rp>(</rp><rt>てすうりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が５０ドルかかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">该银行为创建这笔货币付出了50美元的费用。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">瓦</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">瓦片；屋顶瓦</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">代わり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">代替品；替代品；代替；替身；代理人；副手；接班人；代价；交换；回报；再来一份；续杯；加量；接下来的节目</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"208274\">その<ruby>代<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わりにトランプをしようよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">换句话说,我们要做特朗普。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">代る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">接替；替代；顶替；代替；代班；代表；（电话）转接；互换；交换位置；调换</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216033\">ジムは、ベティーにかわって<ruby>手紙<rp>(</rp><rt>てがみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">吉姆向贝蒂写了一封信。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">変わる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">改变；转变；变化；搬迁；移居；不同寻常；与众不同</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">代わる代わる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわるがわる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">轮流；交替；依次</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123077\"><ruby>二人<rp>(</rp><rt>ふたり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はかわるがわる<ruby>試<rp>(</rp><rt>こころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两人试图互动。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">勘</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">知觉；直觉；第六感</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"208817\">その<ruby>新聞記者<rp>(</rp><rt>しんぶんきしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はニュースを<ruby>嗅<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎつける<ruby>鋭<rp>(</rp><rt>するど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>勘<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这位记者对新闻的气味很强烈。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">管</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">管；管子；管状物；管乐器；（解剖）脉管；导管；（体内的）道、管（如消化道、耳道）；管状物的计数词</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183844\"><ruby>管<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>吹<rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">管道上流出水。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">缶</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">罐；听；罐头；罐装食品</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197656\">ビールをもう１<ruby>缶<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いただけますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我可以再喝一杯啤酒吗?</span></div></li>"]